# Badlands Revival returns its first target to the battlefield and its second to its controller's hand, in that order
# (CR 608.2c). The creature target accepts only a creature card in its controller's graveyard: Bot2's Grizzly Bears in
# Bot2's graveyard and the Lightning Bolt in Bot1's are no candidates; the permanent target accepts Black Lotus (an
# artifact card) but not the Bolt. The two returns are two instructions, so cards leave the graveyard twice and
# Attuned Hunter ("Whenever one or more cards leave your graveyard during your turn") triggers twice (CR 603.2c). The Elves
# enter untapped.
# Badlands Revival {3}{B}{G}: Sorcery
#   Return up to one target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. Return up to one target permanent card
#   from your graveyard to your hand.

